1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:03,610
Press Ctrl+K to open the command palette.

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:08,560
It lists what you can type.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:15,510
Type chart and an instrument, then press Enter, to open its chart.

4
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:22,630
Type goto and a tab name to jump to that tab.

5
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:26,630
Buy and sell place an order as soon as you press Enter, so check it first.

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:34,200
Press Escape to close the palette without doing anything.

7
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,220
The question mark at the bottom right is Help.

8
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:42,310
It opens the Trader Manual, and lists the keyboard shortcuts.

9
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:53,190
Every shortcut is listed here. Shift+F1 opens this from anywhere.

10
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:58,620
In Settings, under Trading, you can turn notifications on or off.

11
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:05,730
Below that, you choose which events play a sound, and how loud.

